{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2141","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G. Good Robot Paths"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"7.5 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"On a Cartesian plane, there are $$$n$$$ distinct points painted black, while all other points are painted white. Each black point has integer coordinates."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There is also a robot that can move one unit in any of the directions '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"U"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' (up), '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' (down), '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"L"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' (left), or '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"R"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' (right) with a single command."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A path of the robot from point $$$p_{1}$$$ to point $$$p_{2}$$$ is a sequence of commands such that if the robot, starting at point $$$p_{1}$$$, executes this sequence, it will arrive at point $$$p_{2}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The shortest path of the robot from point $$$p_{1}$$$ to point $$$p_{2}$$$ is a path whose sequence consists of the minimum possible number of commands."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You need to count the number of pairs of points $$$p_i$$$, $$$p_j$$$ ($$$i \\neq j$$$) such that for this pair of 